From a7d3947f55d94df5347b740c4430ae00eee75ce1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fernando Luiz Cola <fernando.luiz@pantacor.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 17:10:11 -0300
Subject: [RFC PATCH 7/7] pantavisor: new package

Pantavisor is a container-based init and update agent for embedded
Linux: it runs as PID 1 from the initramfs, starts the system's
containers with lxc and installs new revisions of them, locally or from
Pantacor Hub. https://pantavisor.io

The package builds it in "embedded" mode and installs /init as a link
to it, with the initramfs layout it expects: /storage, /volumes,
/exports and /writable, and /pv, /media and /configs as links into
/run/pantavisor. So PANTAVISOR depends on !ROOTFS_MEDIA.

It links libevent22 statically, from its private prefix, and libthttp
and picohttpparser. Selecting it turns on the Pantavisor patch series
of lxc, busybox and dropbear. The shipped pantavisor.config is adjusted
at install time:

 - PV_SECUREBOOT_HANDLERS follows PANTAVISOR_DM_VERITY; since 031 it
   is on and checks dm: volumes.
 - PV_SYSTEM_CGROUP_VERSION=auto; unset means cgroup v1 in embedded
   mode.

/etc/lxc/lxc.conf points lxc.lxcpath to /usr/var/lib/lxc, where
Pantavisor keeps its containers, so lxc-info and lxc-console find them
without -P.

Three patches:

 - gen_version.sh takes the version from PV_GIT_DESCRIBE: a build from
   the source tarball has no .git, and git describe would describe
   whatever repository the build directory is in.
 - the lxc plugin drops an include of pv_export.h, a header only
   Pantavisor's lxc fork has.
 - JWS ES256/384/512 signatures are raw R || S, but mbedtls_pk_verify()
   takes DER; convert them before verifying, so mbedtls needs no patch.

All three are for Pantavisor upstream as well.

The Pantavisor developer trust store is not installed
(PANTAVISOR_PVS_SKIP_INSTALL=ON): a product brings its own in
/etc/pantavisor/pvs, e.g. from projectroot.

Signed-off-by: Fernando Luiz Cola <fernando.luiz@pantacor.com>
---
 ...w-overriding-the-version-via-PV_GIT_.patch |  36 +++++
 ...-drop-the-unused-pv_export.h-include.patch |  27 ++++
 ...t-raw-ECDSA-signatures-to-DER-before.patch | 126 +++++++++++++++
 patches/pantavisor-031/series                 |   3 +
 rules/pantavisor.in                           | 112 +++++++++++++
 rules/pantavisor.make                         | 151 ++++++++++++++++++
